    <div class="code-thumb"><span class="p">$</span> mesh-llm <span class="f">share</span> <span class="v">http://localhost:11434</span></div>
    <p class="mt-3"><a href="/docs/pages/share-model-server/">Share an existing model server</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
